---
name: fastapi-best-practices.mdc

description: Best practices for FastAPI applications

globs: **/*.py

---

- Use Pydantic models for data validation and serialization.

- Implement dependency injection for better modularity.

- Use async functions for I/O-bound operations.

- Secure your API with OAuth2 and JWT authentication.

- Organize routes and services to promote reusability and maintainability.
